t_Remira.png/25px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/38px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/50px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png/25px-Portrait_Remira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Portrait_Remira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remira\" title=\"Remira\">Remira</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A letter stamped with the bright seal of Ansur's Finest, an adventuring guild based in Baldur's Gate.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Citizen Remira,\n</p><p>We received your application with interest, and noted your experience in the field with great enthusiasm. However, your letter's repeated reference to 'pay' and 'bounty' indicate motivations perhaps at odds with those of the Finest.\n</p><p>We are sure you would make a fine addition to any adventuring guild, and wish you luck in finding one more compatible with your own particular priorities.\n</p><p>Regards, etc.,\n</p><p>Sevrin Bask\n</p><p>Recruitment Officer for Ansur's Finest\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715064717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1601/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27198/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7697/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935681/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time repor